{
  "info": {
    "name": "MASH Mushroom Automation System Administration & Monitoring API",
    "description": "System administration, health monitoring, and diagnostic tools for MASH Mushroom Automation System. This collection includes health checks, system monitoring, debug utilities, and system maintenance operations for comprehensive system oversight.",
